[# mermaid_flowchart.j2 — fenced mermaid block from a .mmd evidence file.
   3/7 surveyed PRs used a flowchart; ALL were `flowchart LR` (zero sequence/state diagrams).

   Variables expected in scope:
     diagram_path:  path to .mmd file, relative to the --evidence directory
                    (absolute paths are also honored)

   Convention: store diagrams in evidence/diagrams/*.mmd

   Example .mmd content:
     flowchart LR
         A["Source table"] --> B["Stage model"]
         B --> C["Intermediate model"]
         C --> D["Mart"]
#]

[[ diagram_path | mermaid ]]
